OL,3,GNEWSAHope for more government funds for
OL,4,Abreakfast clubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government minister has said he is
OL,7,F"hopeful" there will be more funding
OL,8,Ffor free breakfast clubs in next week's
OL,9,FBudget on a visit to a Bournemouth
OL,10,Fschool.
OL,12,FEarly Years Minster Paul Waugh joined
OL,13,Fprimary school pupils using the service
OL,14,Fat Jewell Academy in Townsend on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,17,FThe Department of Education said its
OL,18,Fown research showed the clubs were
OL,19,Fhelping children make friends and
OL,20,Fdevelop social skills, while saving
OL,21,Ftheir parents money.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
